-- 41D(1) is "subject to the exceptions in subsection (2) and section 41E". Reading taken (fork F18 of NOTES.md):
-- 41E displaces 41D(1) for the matters 41E lists, in the Singapore International Commercial Court, and 41D(1)
-- applies to every other matter; 41D(2) reverses only a reference to a second-column matter.
-- src:1829 | 41D.—(1) As from 1 April 2022, a reference in any written law to a
-- src:1830 | matter mentioned in the first column is to be construed as a reference
-- src:1873 | (2) Despite subsection (1), a reference in any written law to a matter
-- src:1874 | mentioned in the second column of the table in subsection (1) in
-- src:1875 | relation to any proceedings commenced before 15 October 2024 in
-- src:1876 | the Family Division of the High Court, a Family Court or a Youth
-- src:1877 | Court is to be construed as a reference to the corresponding
-- src:1878 | expression in the first column of that table.
-- src:1890 | 41E. As from 1 April 2022, a reference in any written law to a
-- src:1891 | matter mentioned in the first column in relation to any proceedings in
-- src:1892 | the Singapore International Commercial Court is to be construed as a
-- src:1893 | reference to the corresponding expression in the second column:
@ref s 41D(1), (2) and s 41E how a reference is construed (src:1829-1893)
GIVEN `the expression` IS A STRING
      `the day it is read` IS A DATE
      `the proceedings` IS A `Proceedings a reference is made in relation to`
GIVETH A MAYBE STRING
`the reference is construed as a reference to` `the expression` `the day it is read` `the proceedings` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the day it is read` BELOW Date 1 4 2022 THEN NOTHING
        IF `the proceedings` EQUALS `proceedings in the Singapore International Commercial Court`
           AND (NOT (null (filter (GIVEN row YIELD row's `first column` EQUALS `the expression`) `the table of section 41E`))) THEN
            CONSIDER filter (GIVEN row YIELD row's `first column` EQUALS `the expression`) `the table of section 41E`
            WHEN EMPTY THEN NOTHING
            WHEN row FOLLOWED BY rest THEN JUST (row's `second column`)
        IF `the proceedings` EQUALS `proceedings commenced before 15 October 2024 in the Family Division of the High Court, a Family Court or a Youth Court`
           AND (NOT (null (filter (GIVEN row YIELD row's `second column` EQUALS `the expression`) `the table of section 41D(1)`))) THEN
            CONSIDER filter (GIVEN row YIELD row's `second column` EQUALS `the expression`) `the table of section 41D(1)`
            WHEN EMPTY THEN NOTHING
            WHEN row FOLLOWED BY rest THEN JUST (row's `first column`)
        OTHERWISE
            CONSIDER filter (GIVEN row YIELD row's `first column` EQUALS `the expression`) `the table of section 41D(1)`
            WHEN EMPTY THEN NOTHING
            WHEN row FOLLOWED BY rest THEN JUST (row's `second column`)
